00:56:05.770 --> 00:56:07.300
Serhan Dagtas: Yeah, yeah.

521
00:56:07.430 --> 00:56:19.830
Serhan Dagtas: And then answer the survey and respond back. So I myself have been in that situation and I found myself responding to surveys that I otherwise would not have.

522
00:56:20.080 --> 00:56:28.319
Serhan Dagtas: Because in a situation like this, you have no way of returning the money or the survey itself.

523
00:56:28.500 --> 00:56:32.169
Serhan Dagtas: And in many cases you just,

524
00:56:32.470 --> 00:56:34.290
Serhan Dagtas: Kind of feel obliged to.

